1
00:00:00,336 --> 00:00:02,636
(Leonard:)How does your brain feel about
calculating the surface tension

2
00:00:02,639 --> 00:00:03,909
(Leonard:)of the domain walls?

3
00:00:03,907 --> 00:00:06,207
(Sheldon:)Let's see.

4
00:00:06,209 --> 00:00:07,409
(begins tune)

5
00:00:07,410 --> 00:00:10,510
Hey! I was humming.

6
00:00:10,513 --> 00:00:13,713
(Sheldon:)One point
for Hufflepuff.

7
00:00:13,716 --> 00:00:16,656
(repeats tune)

8
00:00:16,653 --> 00:00:18,583
(Sheldon:)What song is that?

9
00:00:18,588 --> 00:00:21,418
(Leonard:)Well... Hum it again.

10
00:00:21,424 --> 00:00:23,324
(repeats tune)

11
00:00:23,326 --> 00:00:25,126
Is that the SpongeBob song?

12
00:00:25,128 --> 00:00:29,298
(to same tune): ♪ Who lives
in a pineapple ♪ Nope.

13
00:00:29,299 --> 00:00:30,699
(Leonard:)Whatever. Can we just
get back to this?

14
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:32,070
(Sheldon:)I feel like I know
what song that is,

15
00:00:32,068 --> 00:00:34,598
(Sheldon:)but I can't put
my finger on it.

16
00:00:34,604 --> 00:00:37,774
♪ My country, 'tis of thee ♪
No.

17
00:00:37,774 --> 00:00:40,444
(Leonard:)It's just an earworm.
It'll come to you.

18
00:00:40,443 --> 00:00:43,243
(Sheldon:)Okay.

19
00:00:45,181 --> 00:00:47,151
♪ R-E-S-P-E-C-T ♪

20
00:00:47,150 --> 00:00:48,580
(Sheldon:)No.

21
00:00:48,585 --> 00:00:50,785
(Leonard:)Is this what we're doing
the rest of the night?

22
00:00:50,787 --> 00:00:53,917
♪ I'm surprised
you have to ask... ♪

23
00:00:53,923 --> 00:00:57,393
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

